  "details": "After playing with access to the new accessibility emojis for a little while now I think that a respawn icon emoji would be really helpful.\n\nA lot of the time, needing to tell someone to respawn happens when something is glitching out, you're stuck, etc. and as a mute there are definitely times where I've needed to tell people to respawn but couldn't because I wasn't close enough, because I can't type while moving, because something is obstructing my chatbox, etc.\n\nI imagine this would look like the 🔄️ respawn icon (perhaps with a person next to it like the portal emoji?) and would be a perfect fit alongside the \"portal\" icon emoji in the wheel due to their similar \"I need you to do this built in feature\" use cases.\n\nThanks!",
